WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:06.212
Mark: Do you think Mr. Lenny is in danger?

2
00:00:06.213 --> 00:00:08.983
Coby: I'm not sure.

3
00:00:08.984 --> 00:00:12.988
Hey . . . Maybe we should spy on

4
00:00:12.989 --> 00:00:14.852
him! Mark: Spy on

5
00:00:14.853 --> 00:00:17.279
him? What

6
00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:20.281
for? Coby: To see if he needs

7
00:00:20.282 --> 00:00:26.774
help. Mark: Mr. Lenny might need help, but not from

8
00:00:26.775 --> 00:00:31.219
kids. And remember what your mom said?

9
00:00:31.220 --> 00:00:36.166
Coby: Yes. She said I can use my spy kit to help

10
00:00:36.167 --> 00:00:42.267
people. And this would be helping someone—Mr. Lenny.

11
00:00:42.268 --> 00:00:45.140
Mark: I don't know, Coby.

12
00:00:45.141 --> 00:00:46.762
Coby: Come on, Mark.

13
00:00:46.763 --> 00:00:50.620
Let's just spy on him for a little while.

14
00:00:50.621 --> 00:00:54.314
To make sure that he's not in danger.

15
00:00:54.315 --> 00:00:56.503
Mark: Okay, fine.

16
00:00:56.504 --> 00:01:16.013
But I don't think this is a good idea . . .

17
00:01:16.014 --> 00:01:19.172
Coby: School's over.

18
00:01:19.173 --> 00:01:31.929
So Mr. Lenny should be going home soon.

19
00:01:31.930 --> 00:01:34.857
Mark: He doesn't look ready to go

20
00:01:34.858 --> 00:01:47.280
home. He's still picking up trash.

21
00:01:47.281 --> 00:01:52.565
Coby: Now he's helping that lady cross the street.

22
00:01:52.566 --> 00:01:55.485
Mark: And talking to those kids.

23
00:01:55.486 --> 00:01:57.792
This is getting boring, Coby.

24
00:01:57.793 --> 00:02:00.616
I don't think Mr. Lenny needs our— Coby:

25
00:02:00.617 --> 00:02:12.909
Shh. He's finally locking the doors!

26
00:02:12.910 --> 00:02:14.726
Mark: Where's he going?

27
00:02:14.727 --> 00:02:16.149
Coby: I'm not sure.

28
00:02:16.150 --> 00:02:25.850
Let's follow him!

29
00:02:25.851 --> 00:02:30.315
Mark: I think he's heading for the bank.

30
00:02:30.316 --> 00:02:34.197
Coby: Oh no! Remember what the note said?

31
00:02:34.198 --> 00:02:43.636
Mark: Yep. It said, "Bring my money . . . Or

32
00:02:43.637 --> 00:02:59.439
else!" Uh-oh! Here comes Mr. Lenny . . .

33
00:02:59.440 --> 00:03:02.018
Coby: With all his money!

